    third tab offered /portal/courses to people who have no course. What it cost most is the same
    thing it cost the attendance screens: the sign-out and the account block live in the drawer, and a
    static bar has no drawer, so there was no way to end a session from the task board.

    `active="tasks"` was at least honest here, and it stays honest: buildWorkspaceNav resolves the lit
    tab from the path, and /portal/tasks is the Tasks destination's own href. */}
